    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >AN UNLIKELY CITY IN THE DESERT</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3230560/extras/8197056b6fb8258566ad8ba80e963edb.poster.avif?t=1752104442\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3230560/extras/8197056b6fb8258566ad8ba80e963edb.webm?t=1752104442\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3230560/extras/8197056b6fb8258566ad8ba80e963edb.mp4?t=1752104442\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Storm settlers is a survival citybuilder set in a desert afflicted by relentless sandstorms. Lead your group of settlers to build a city in this inhospitable environment. With scarce resources and unfavorable odds, your only hope is to drill deep into the ground to reach the water table and save the settlement. Will you find water or desolation? Will your settlement thrive or be buried in sand?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >PROTECT FROM THE STORM</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3230560/extras/5ed7bc478ea671cb2d57d70935b629a9.poster.avif?t=1752104442\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3230560/extras/5ed7bc478ea671cb2d57d70935b629a9.webm?t=1752104442\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3230560/extras/5ed7bc478ea671cb2d57d70935b629a9.mp4?t=1752104442\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The desert\u2019s lack of food and water won\u2019t be the only challenge you\u2019ll face. Relentless sandstorms will hit your settlement. Be careful where you build your city and erect walls to protect your people from the forever-moving sands of the desert.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3230560/extras/bf5c3aecf9ec638c891828b480678cef.poster.avif?t=1752104442\" width=600 height=148 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3230560/extras/bf5c3aecf9ec638c891828b480678cef.webm?t=1752104442\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3230560/extras/bf5c3aecf9ec638c891828b480678cef.mp4?t=1752104442\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build a city with roads and various building types and assign your settlers to work.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome or reject new people looking for a place to settle in this unforgiving desert.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage your limited resources to feed and hydrate your people to keep them alive.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Research technologies to unlock new buildings and skills to improve your odds of survival.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the desert to find rare and indispensable resources.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight the sandstorm by building walls and digging away the spreading sand.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Research and build a powerful drill to dig deep into the earth to find the water table and save the settlement.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock new skins and customization options through progressing in the game.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >no microtransactions.</p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Modify the terrain by breaking rocks, growing new patches of grass and digging away sand to expand your buildable area.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trade with traveling merchants.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In-game encyclopedia detailing Storm Settlers' many elements so you can learn at your own pace.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Different environments including desert and tundra biomes.</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >AN UNLIKELY CITY IN THE DESERT</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3230560/extras/8197056b6fb8258566ad8ba80e963edb.poster.avif?t=1752104442\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3230560/extras/8197056b6fb8258566ad8ba80e963edb.webm?t=1752104442\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3230560/extras/8197056b6fb8258566ad8ba80e963edb.mp4?t=1752104442\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Storm settlers is a survival citybuilder set in a desert afflicted by relentless sandstorms. Lead your group of settlers to build a city in this inhospitable environment. With scarce resources and unfavorable odds, your only hope is to drill deep into the ground to reach the water table and save the settlement. Will you find water or desolation? Will your settlement thrive or be buried in sand?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >PROTECT FROM THE STORM</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3230560/extras/5ed7bc478ea671cb2d57d70935b629a9.poster.avif?t=1752104442\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3230560/extras/5ed7bc478ea671cb2d57d70935b629a9.webm?t=1752104442\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3230560/extras/5ed7bc478ea671cb2d57d70935b629a9.mp4?t=1752104442\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The desert\u2019s lack of food and water won\u2019t be the only challenge you\u2019ll face. Relentless sandstorms will hit your settlement. Be careful where you build your city and erect walls to protect your people from the forever-moving sands of the desert.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3230560/extras/bf5c3aecf9ec638c891828b480678cef.poster.avif?t=1752104442\" width=600 height=148 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3230560/extras/bf5c3aecf9ec638c891828b480678cef.webm?t=1752104442\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3230560/extras/bf5c3aecf9ec638c891828b480678cef.mp4?t=1752104442\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build a city with roads and various building types and assign your settlers to work.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome or reject new people looking for a place to settle in this unforgiving desert.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage your limited resources to feed and hydrate your people to keep them alive.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Research technologies to unlock new buildings and skills to improve your odds of survival.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the desert to find rare and indispensable resources.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight the sandstorm by building walls and digging away the spreading sand.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Research and build a powerful drill to dig deep into the earth to find the water table and save the settlement.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock new skins and customization options through progressing in the game.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >no microtransactions.</p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Modify the terrain by breaking rocks, growing new patches of grass and digging away sand to expand your buildable area.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trade with traveling merchants.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In-game encyclopedia detailing Storm Settlers' many elements so you can learn at your own pace.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Different environments including desert and tundra biomes.</p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "A survival citybuilder set in a desert afflicted by relentless sandstorms. Build, farm, research, clear sand and protect your people from the storms. Will you find water or desolation? Will your settlement thrive or be buried in sand?",
